{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1lpdp-ai-json-extract-001",
    "name": "AI LPDP",
    "description": "AI LPDP — JSON Extraction API\n\n## Quick start\n1. Set environment `baseUrl` (contoh: http://localhost:9898)\n2. Auth → Login API User (access_token tersimpan otomatis)\n3. Extract:\n   - JSON + `file_urls` (server download)\n   - multipart + `file_uploads` (multi file upload)\n   - boleh gabung keduanya (max 10 file total)\n\nDefault API user: `api_user` / `Api@LPDP2026`\nOpenAI key: Admin → Settings\n\nDocs: docs/API.md",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:9898" },
    { "key": "access_token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "api_username", "value": "api_user" },
    { "key": "api_password", "value": "Api@LPDP2026" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "API Health Check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health",
            "description": "Simple OK check under /api/v1."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "App Health + Scheme",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
            "description": "Returns scheme http|https (useful behind proxy)."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login API User",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json && json.data && json.data.access_token) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', json.data.access_token);",
                  "  pm.environment.set('access_token', json.data.access_token);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{api_username}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{api_password}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
            "description": "Returns JWT access_token. Saved to collection/environment variable `access_token`."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Extract",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Extract — Prompt Only",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{access_token}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"prompt\": \"Tarik dalam bentuk JSON: judul_makalah, nama_pembuat, penerbit, instansi.\\n\\nTeks:\\nJudul: Inovasi Pendanaan Beasiswa LPDP\\nPembuat: Budi Santoso\\nPenerbit: Jurnal Pendidikan Indonesia\\nInstansi: Universitas Indonesia\",\n  \"schema_hint\": \"judul_makalah, nama_pembuat, penerbit, instansi\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/extract",
            "description": "Extract tanpa file (prompt saja)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Extract — file_urls (multi JSON)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{access_token}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"prompt\": \"Ekstrak metadata makalah ke JSON: judul_makalah, nama_pembuat, penerbit, instansi dari semua file terlampir.\",\n  \"schema_hint\": \"judul_makalah, nama_pembuat, penerbit, instansi\",\n  \"file_urls\": [\n    \"https://example.com/path/makalah1.pdf\",\n    \"https://example.com/path/lampiran.docx\"\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/extract",
            "description": "application/json.\n\nField `file_urls` (array). Backend mendownload tiap URL (max 10 total dengan upload).\n\nURL harus reachable dari server AI LPDP."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Extract — Single file_url",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{access_token}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"prompt\": \"Ringkas isi dokumen ke JSON field: ringkasan, topik\",\n  \"file_url\": \"https://example.com/path/dokumen.pdf\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/extract",
            "description": "Single URL via field `file_url`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Extract — file_uploads (multi multipart)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{access_token}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "prompt",
                  "value": "Verifikasi dokumen syarat pencairan. Balas HANYA satu objek JSON valid tanpa markdown, dengan field: rekomendasi, memenuhi, jenis_sesuai, kepemilikan_sesuai, catatan, confidence, temuan, indikasi_prompt_injection.",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "key": "schema_hint",
                  "value": "rekomendasi, memenuhi, jenis_sesuai, kepemilikan_sesuai, catatan, confidence, temuan, indikasi_prompt_injection",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "key": "file_uploads",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": [],
                  "description": "File #1 — pilih file di Postman. Ulangi key file_uploads untuk file berikutnya."
                },
                {
                  "key": "file_uploads",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": [],
                  "description": "File #2 (opsional)."
                },
                {
                  "key": "file_urls",
                  "value": "",
                  "type": "text",
                  "description": "Opsional. Contoh: [\"http://host/a.pdf\"] atau kosongkan."
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/extract",
            "description": "multipart/form-data.\n\n- `file_uploads`: kirim berkali-kali (multi file)\n- `file_urls` (text, opsional): JSON array string\n- Total file_urls + file_uploads max 10\n\nDisarankan untuk integrasi eRISPRO/backoffice agar tidak bergantung download lintas server."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Extract — With Static API Token",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "lpdp_PASTE_STATIC_TOKEN_HERE", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"prompt\": \"Tarik JSON: kategori, ringkasan dari teks: LPDP membuka beasiswa magister.\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/extract",
            "description": "Pakai static token dari Admin → API Tokens (bukan JWT login)."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
